---@field fast? boolean Anthropic fast mode.

---@class MakiModel
-- Without an interactive UI every function returns `nil, "no interactive UI attached"`.
maki.model = {}

---Read the focused session's model, thinking level, and fast mode. A table
---from here can go straight back into `set`.
---@return MakiModelState|nil state `{spec, id, provider, thinking, thinking_options, fast, supports_thinking, supports_fast}`, or nil plus an error.
---@return string|nil err
function maki.model.get() end

---Switch the focused session's model/thinking/fast. Omitted fields stay as
---they are. Answers with the new state, in the same shape `get` returns.
