---@param content string Text to write.
---@return true|nil ok true on success, or nil plus an error message.
---@return string|nil err
function maki.fs.write(path, content) end

---Find files matching glob pattern(s), walked fresh on every call. Respects
---`.gitignore` by default. Requires the `fs_read` permission.
---@param pattern string|string[] Glob pattern or array of patterns.
---@param opts? MakiGlobOpts
---@return string[]|nil files Array of absolute file paths, or nil plus an error.
---@return string|nil err
function maki.fs.glob(pattern, opts) end

