---@class MakiPlanReadOpts
---@field session? string Session id; defaults to focused. Plan state is per session.

---@class MakiPlanState
---@field mode MakiSessionMode `"plan"` or `"build"`.
---@field path? string Absolute plan path once the session has one, else nil.
---@field content? string File contents; nil when the plan is not ready or the read failed.
---@field ready boolean True once the agent has written the plan file.

---@class MakiPlan
