maki.env = {}

---Directory holding runtime state (sessions, auth tokens, ...), e.g.
---`~/.local/state/maki`.
---@return string|nil dir State directory path, or nil if it cannot be determined.
function maki.env.state_dir() end

---Directory maki reads user configuration from, e.g. `~/.config/maki`.
